<section class="v27-scene v27-freedom-scene" id="financial-freedom" aria-label="Original RIPL financial freedom journey"><div class="v27-scene-pin"><iframe title="Original RIPL Financial Freedom topographic climb animation" src="/ripl-original-freedom.html" loading="lazy" tabindex="-1"></iframe></div></section>
<section class="v27-adam wrap"><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam-studio-hero.webp" alt="Adam Kasick at RIPL Wealth" loading="lazy"/><div><p class="eyebrow">A PERSONAL INTRODUCTION</p><h2>I've been on your <em>side of the table.</em></h2><p>I know what it takes to build a business. Let's make sure the financial decisions behind it support the life you're building.</p><a href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="adam">Let's talk →</a></div></section>
<div class="section-band section-band--white"><section class="section wrap story-section" id="recognition"><figure class="recognition-team-photo"><img src="/images/ripl-home-team.jpg" width="1536" height="1024" alt="The RIPL Wealth team together at their office" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></figure><p class="eyebrow">THE BIGGER PICTURE</p><h2>THE BUSINESS IS BUILT. <em>NOW LET'S BUILD YOUR FINANCIAL FREEDOM.</em></h2><div class="story-copy"><p>You've probably spent years making decisions that move your business forward.</p><p>Hiring the right people. Finding opportunities. Solving problems. Making sure things get done.</p><p>But here's something worth thinking about:</p><p><strong>Who's giving that same attention to the life you're building outside your business?</strong></p><p>Maybe you already have a CPA, an investment advisor, and other professionals you trust. That's great.</p><p>But who's connecting all those moving parts to what you actually want your life to look like?</p><p><strong>Because having good people working on individual pieces isn't always the same as having someone focused on the whole picture.</strong></p></div></section></div>
<div class="section-band section-band--warm"><section class="section wrap story-section clarity" id="clarity"><p class="eyebrow">CLARITY BEFORE PRODUCTS</p><h2>YOU'RE <em>REALLY SMART.</em></h2><blockquote class="adam-quote">“Successful people make excellent decisions when they can see their options with clarity.”<cite>— Adam Kasick</cite></blockquote><div class="story-copy"><p>You built a successful business by making good decisions. You don't need someone telling you what to do.</p><p>But what if there are financial strategies you haven't had the chance to explore?</p><p><strong>The right conversation can introduce new options, clarify the trade-offs, and help turn good ideas into action.</strong></p></div><a class="button quiz-entry-button section-cta" href="#quiz" data-quiz-link data-placement="clarity">Take the Free Quiz →</a></section></div>
<div class="section-band section-band--warm"><section class="section wrap market-plus" id="market-plus"><p class="eyebrow">THE RIPL INVESTMENT PHILOSOPHY</p><h2>MARKET PLUS.</h2><h3>WHAT SHOULD YOUR MONEY REALLY BE DOING FOR YOU?</h3><p>The market has been a powerful engine for wealth creation. Consider the S&amp;P 500 over 15 complete calendar years:</p><div class="market-chart"><div class="market-chart-top"><strong>2011–2025 · S&amp;P 500 total return</strong><span>Dividends reinvested</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 850 230" role="img" aria-label="S&P 500 calendar-year total return growth, 2011 through 2025, with declines in 2018 and 2022" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><line x1="30" y1="200" x2="820" y2="200" stroke="#c9c4d7"/><polyline points="30.0,177.1 82.7,176.6 135.3,172.8 188.0,164.0 240.7,159.1 293.3,158.5 346.0,153.6 398.7,143.5 451.3,145.9 504.0,128.9 556.7,115.8 609.3,91.7 662.0,111.3 714.7,87.9 767.3,59.9 820.0,34.9" fill="none" stroke="#6d4d9d" stroke-width="5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="820.0" cy="34.9" r="6" fill="#c6a566"/><text x="30" y="223" font-size="14" fill="#5d5868">2010 close</text><text x="820" y="223" font-size="14" text-anchor="end" fill="#5d5868">2025 close</text></svg><p class="market-chart-note">Year-end values based on published calendar-year total returns. Includes down years; no smoothing. <a href="https://www.slickcharts.com/sp500/returns/details" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Historical data and methodology ↗</a></p></div><h3>BUT RETURNS ARE ONLY PART OF THE STORY.</h3><p>What about taxes, investment income, risks, and whether your portfolio is aligned with the life you're building?</p><p><strong>At RIPL, we believe every dollar should have a job.</strong> Market Plus means looking beyond returns alone: tax awareness, income opportunities, customization, and thoughtful risk management.</p><p class="market-disclosure">The chart shows historical performance of an unmanaged index, not RIPL or client results. The S&amp;P 500 cannot be invested in directly; index returns exclude advisory fees, trading costs, and investor taxes. Past performance does not predict future results. Market Plus does not promise outperformance or any particular outcome. All strategies carry risks, costs and limitations; income and tax benefits are not guaranteed.</p></section></div>
<div class="section-band section-band--white"><section class="section wrap story-section how-help" id="how-help"><p class="eyebrow">HOW I HELP</p><h2>GOOD IDEAS AREN'T ENOUGH. <em>EXECUTION IS EVERYTHING.</em></h2><div class="story-copy"><p>You've probably got a list of financial things you've been meaning to get around to.</p><p>Ideas you've had. Conversations you need to have. Decisions you know deserve attention.</p><p>The problem usually isn't a shortage of good ideas.</p><p><strong>It's finding the time to turn them into action.</strong></p><p>And when you finally have some free time, shouldn't you get to enjoy it?</p><p>That's where I come in.</p><p>My role is to bring ideas worth considering, help organize conversations with your other financial professionals, and work with you on next steps—so important decisions get the attention they deserve.</p><h3>Think of me as a point of coordination for your financial decisions.</h3><p>Your CPA, attorney, insurance professional, and investment advisor each have important responsibilities. I help you see how their work fits together and who owns the next step. Each professional remains responsible for advice within their own specialty.</p></div><a class="button outline section-cta" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="how-help">Let's Talk About Your Options →</a></section></div>

<div class="section-band section-band--white"><section class="section wrap library" id="videos"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">MORE FROM ADAM</p><h2>A few more <em>good ideas.</em></h2><p>Short videos about situations real business owners face. If one sounds familiar, bring it to our conversation.</p></div><div id="video-grid" class="video-grid">{featuredVideos.map(v=><article class="video-card" data-video-stage={v.stage}><div class="video-thumb" data-video-container>{v.youtubeId?<button class="video-play-button" type="button" data-video-id={v.youtubeId} aria-label={`Play ${v.title} on this page`}><img loading="lazy" src={v.thumbnail || `https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${v.youtubeId}/maxresdefault.jpg?v=20261029`} onerror={v.thumbnail ? undefined : `this.onerror=null;this.src='https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${v.youtubeId}/hqdefault.jpg?v=20261029';`} alt=""/><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span></button>:<><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam.webp" loading="lazy" alt=""/><span>Soon</span></>}</div><div><h3>{v.title}</h3><p>{v.summary}</p>{!v.youtubeId&&<span class="video-soon">Video coming soon</span>}</div></article>)}</div></section></div>

<div class="section-band section-band--warm"><section class="section wrap closing-invite" id="booking"><p class="eyebrow">LET'S TALK</p><h2>YOU'VE WORKED HARD TO BUILD YOUR BUSINESS. <em>WHAT'S NEXT?</em></h2><div class="story-copy"><p>Maybe you've got a financial question that's been on your mind for months. Maybe there's an opportunity you haven't had time to explore. Or maybe you'd just like another perspective from someone who understands business ownership.</p><p>Whatever brought you here, I'd enjoy hearing about it.</p><p><strong>Twenty minutes to discuss what's on your mind, explore a few possibilities, and see whether working together makes sense.</strong></p></div><a class="button primary section-cta" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="final">Let's Talk About Your Options →</a><p class="fine">A conversation, not a sales pitch.</p><div class="secondary-path"><h3>NOT READY TO TALK YET? THAT'S OKAY.</h3><p>Start with nine questions designed to help you think about your business, your money, and the life you're building.</p><a href="#ask-question">Ask Us a Question →</a></div></section></div>
<div class="section-band section-band--white"><section class="section wrap question-section" id="ask-question"><p class="eyebrow">ANOTHER WAY TO START</p><h2>HAVE A QUESTION? <em>ASK US.</em></h2><p>You don't need to take a quiz or schedule a meeting to ask what's on your mind. Please don't include account numbers, tax returns, or other sensitive information.</p><form id="ask-question-form"><div class="question-form-fields"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required/></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required/></label></div><label>Your question<textarea name="question" rows="5" maxlength="2000" required></textarea></label><div class="lead-honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label></div><button class="button primary" type="submit">Send My Question</button><p id="ask-question-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="fine">We'll use your information to respond. Sending a question does not subscribe you to marketing emails. <a href="/money-at-work-privacy/">Privacy details</a>.</p></form><p>Prefer to talk? <a href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/20-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="question">Book a free 20-minute Zoom conversation</a>.</p></section></div>
